      "phase_acceptance": "Publish exact HANYAO project binding and GitHub bounded control locator; ship read-only D1 + Google Ads date-scoped inspector; execute fresh 2026-09-17 readback; preserve provider-write and delivery invariants.",
      "next_phase": "NATURAL_E2E_MONITORING",
      "next_business_event": "Run a fresh date-scoped closure readback for the next real Ads-attributed LINE contact and compare D1 lineage, Data Manager evidence, and Google Ads reporting.",
